&lt;p&gt;Are you in a direct sales role and thinking of transitioning into partner sales, or do you have experience developing strategic partnerships with large system integrators like Deloitte, Capgemini, Accenture, DXC, etc.? We’re looking for experienced salespeople who’ve leveraged partners to achieve their goals and want to build on this experience in a fully fledged partner sales role. Partners will be a key strategic focus as we move into our next stage of growth. Come and help power the iPaaS revolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
