&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execute strategies to drive key joint customer engagements at our Partners&#39; top end-user customers, focusing on positioning, selling, and implementing Workato solutions. Establish and nurture relationships with sales leadership in our partners to build mutually beneficial go-to-market motions.&lt;/p&gt;
