&lt;p&gt;The Associate Creative Designer, as part of the Marketing Team, supports the graphics &amp;amp; visual needs of the APJ region for &lt;strong&gt;3 months&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the Lead Designer, Brand Team, and other members of the marketing department to interpret creative briefs and meet production needs on a variety of marketing initiatives, campaigns, and events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinating with teams across Workato to brainstorm and identify design requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interpret design briefs, align with and manage stakeholders to ensure designs meet high quality standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing digital creatives (e.g. LED displays, landing pages, social media graphics, slide decks, videos)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing print materials (e.g. Large format signage, booth graphics, corporate swag) and ensuring they are production-ready&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare artwork according to technical specifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and manage a range of creative assets including illustrations, icons, and layouts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create mockups and visualizations of booths and event venues spaces&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinating with vendors to ensure smooth production of designs in a timely manner&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinating with the Marketing team to brainstorm and identify the needs and specifications of the designs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinating with stakeholders to interpret design briefs, and ensuring designs meet expectations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Present, justify and defend design decisions to stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
