&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Graphic Design, Design Communications, Graphic Communication, or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with motion graphics software (e.g. After Effects, Premiere Pro, CapCut)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with Figma&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some experience with 3D software (e.g. Blender) is highly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong illustration, iconography, and typography skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent copywriting and presentation skills is required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1-2 years of experience with working in a marketing environment and/or design agency is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with project management is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Singapore&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to work independently with exceptional attention to detail, and achieve required results within deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills, able to cross-collaborate within own and other departments, and with external vendors and agencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills, able to plan for contingencies and resolving design issues so that projects remain on schedule&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
