&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a motivated Automation Engineer to join our Demo Infrastructure team. You will support the provisioning and management of cloud environments and demo infrastructure, building automations that keep our systems reliable, secure, and scalable — working under the guidance of senior engineers while growing your independence across the delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain infrastructure automations. Develop and maintain automations for cloud provisioning, environment management, and operational tasks using Workato and related tools, following established design patterns and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provision and manage cloud environments. Support the setup, configuration, and maintenance of cloud environments (AWS) for demo and incubation projects, following established standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support CI/CD pipelines. Assist in the implementation and maintenance of CI/CD pipelines and SDLC tooling under the direction of senior engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain demo environments. Support the lifecycle management of demo applications and environments, including configuration, access control, and decommissioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver with quality. Write and execute test cases, troubleshoot issues, and validate that solutions meet requirements before deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document your work. Produce clear documentation of infrastructure configurations, automation solutions, and operational processes to support team knowledge and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invest in growth. Dedicate time to self-directed learning in cloud platforms, automation, and AI to deepen technical expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate effectively. Communicate progress and blockers proactively, and contribute to a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
