&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience delivering automation or integration solutions on iPaaS platforms (Workato, MuleSoft, Boomi, Snaplogic, or similar).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using Linux operating systems - bash - scripts - processes - etc&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working experience with AWS (EC2, S3, IAM, or similar services) in a project or operational context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Docker&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
