&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Gen AI tools (OpenAI, Anthropic, or similar) and vector databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coding experience in Python, Java, or Ruby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of security best practices for cloud environments and data handling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
