&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exercise judgement on scope and priority: including defining the when and the how, with clear rationale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
