&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Use data as the primary input for prioritization and iteration decisions, not an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintain strong data hygiene throughout the program lifecycle, and problem-solve or pivot when new information emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
