&lt;p&gt;5+ years of project management experience with a proven track record of success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years delivering professional services for a strategic consulting firm, large-scale system integrator, or professional services unit within a software company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing 2-3 project resources and project budgets up to $500k USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with common project management methodologies, including Agile Scrum and Waterfall.&amp;nbsp; Actively working on one (1) agile delivery methodology (SPC preferred, CSM, PSM, SAFE Agile, etc.) certification.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in commercial business accounts, with 1-3 enterprise accounts preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop and maintain director/VP-level relationships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to develop and maintain C-level relationships, establishing trust as a strategic advisor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to grow accounts (ARR) and expansion services&lt;/p&gt;
