&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate high energy and have strong project management experience, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Project scoping &amp;amp; planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk &amp;amp; change management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Status reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
