&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Compliance: AWS/GCP/Azure expertise, PCI-DSS, HIPAA, SOC2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Community: Open source contributions, conference speaking, technical writing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
