&lt;p&gt;Validate purchasing requests for completeness, accuracy, budget alignment, and required approvals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage PO amendments, cancellations, closures, and related administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
