&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Go)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Platform team&lt;/strong&gt;. Our platform is a large-scale system combining a Ruby on Rails monolith with a growing ecosystem of Go microservices. In this role, you will build and maintain business logic and enterprise-grade features for the Workato platform, including on-premise features, authentication, caching, work queuing, and APIs.&lt;br&gt;You will also be expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Design, build, and maintain Go microservices with a focus on correctness and reliability.&lt;br&gt;• Implement business logic and enterprise-quality standards across the platform.&lt;br&gt;• Collaborate with Infra and SRE teams to ensure high availability and scalability requirements are met.&lt;br&gt;• Contribute across all phases of the development lifecycle.&lt;br&gt;• Write well-designed, testable, and efficient code.&lt;br&gt;• Evaluate and propose improvements to existing systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 5+ years of industry experience in software engineering.&lt;br&gt;• Solid experience with Go on the backend (2+ years).&lt;br&gt;• Good debugging, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;br&gt;• Understanding of core building blocks of web applications: databases, load balancers, application servers, message brokers, caching, monitoring, etc..&lt;br&gt;• Experience working with distributed systems.&lt;br&gt;• Familiarity with version control (Git) and CI/CD practices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with Ruby on Rails.&lt;br&gt;• Experience building B2B systems.&lt;br&gt;• Experience in related fields (DevOps, ML, DBA, Enterprise applications, etc.).&lt;br&gt;• Experience with third-party REST APIs at scale (request throttling, batch processing, etc.).&lt;br&gt;• Contributions to open-source projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Readiness to work with teams distributed across multiple timezones.&lt;br&gt;• Strong spoken and written English.&lt;br&gt;• Curiosity and openness toward new technologies; willingness to experiment.&lt;br&gt;• Ownership mindset — comfortable taking features from design through to production and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;

