&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building REST APIs and microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of networking fundamentals, HTTP, gRPC, and messaging systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational databases such as PostgreSQL and caching technologies including Redis or Memcached.&lt;/li&gt;
