&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CIOnews is building the editorial and community infrastructure for the next generation of CIO and Enterprise Architect leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;CIOnews.com is a vendor-neutral, independent publication and community backed by Workato, and we&#39;re hiring the first dedicated owner of our community program:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Executive Engagement Programs &amp;amp; Managing Editor&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the CIO and Enterprise Architect community function from the ground up: strategy, program design, member experience, operations, and create the relationships that make it all work. There is no existing playbook to inherit at CIOnews. That requires a builder mindset and creative approach that internalizes the goal to build &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.cionews.com&quot;&gt;www.cionews.com&lt;/a&gt; into the new voice of IT leadership in the AI era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder&#39;s role for someone who thrives in ambiguity. You&#39;ll be defining how CIOnews creates value for the CIO and enterprise architect communities, and help us identify, recruit, and sustain relationships with senior technology leaders. You’ll work closely with our editorial team to convert those relationships into columns, podcast appearances, events, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Building &amp;amp; Activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define the operating model for this community: member lifecycle, how members are identified, onboarded, and kept engaged between touchpoints, and the feedback loops that route ideas back into editorial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan and help execute community activations, including executive dinners, roundtables, and co-branded events with partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propose and evaluate new plays as the community matures — vertical cohorts, recognition programs, awards, or peer working groups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and lead executive engagement programs that establish trusted relationships with CIOs, CTOs, and Enterprise Architects, measuring success through community engagement, executive participation, relationship growth, and long-term organizational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain a working relationship base of CIOs, CTOs, CDOs, CAIOs, CISOs, and Enterprise Architects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent CIOnews credibly in rooms with senior technology leaders, at CIOnews events, dinners, and peer gatherings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for community members, understanding their priorities well enough to make smart, low-friction asks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Source, recruit, and shape story ideas with good editorial judgment drawn from community relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with the CIOnews editorial team to translate practitioner conversations into published content — podcasts, columns, interviews, and feature pieces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring genuine editorial judgment: know a good story when a community member mentions it in passing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1s6b61d&quot; data-start=&quot;497&quot; data-end=&quot;522&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lwcr11&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;538&quot;&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience building and managing executive communities, peer networks, customer advisory boards, or similar programs serving senior technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d0oljv&quot; data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;878&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and scaling community, advocacy, or executive engagement programs within an enterprise SaaS, technology, media, analyst, or consulting organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v5igdx&quot; data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Proven track record of independently building new programs or functions from the ground up, including defining strategy, operational processes, member engagement, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;whncu1&quot; data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Experience developing trusted relationships with senior technology executives, including CIOs, CTOs, CDOs, CISOs, Enterprise Architects, or comparable executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ap3kq6&quot; data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise technology trends and the priorities of CIO and Enterprise Architecture organizations, with the ability to engage credibly in executive conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rvz7hb&quot; data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with content, editorial, marketing, or communications teams to develop thought leadership, executive content, or community-driven programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c4mypu&quot; data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI-powered tools and workflows to improve productivity, scale relationship management, automate repetitive work, and identify content or engagement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1a9n6ci&quot; data-start=&quot;1788&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;2447&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qatvd1&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Experience building or managing CIO, Enterprise Architecture, or executive technology leadership communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;of42sc&quot; data-start=&quot;1929&quot; data-end=&quot;2063&quot;&gt;Experience working at a business publication, industry analyst firm, technology media company, or executive membership organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;htl87c&quot; data-start=&quot;2064&quot; data-end=&quot;2199&quot;&gt;Familiarity with enterprise AI, automation, integration, or digital transformation initiatives and how they impact CIO organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dry2i5&quot; data-start=&quot;2200&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;Existing relationships within CIO communities, enterprise architecture organizations, or executive peer networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13rteas&quot; data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2447&quot;&gt;Experience in planning and delivering executive events such as private dinners, roundtables, advisory boards, or leadership summits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;19pm7cf&quot; data-start=&quot;2449&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Succeed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2470&quot; data-end=&quot;3092&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1am9pnd&quot; data-start=&quot;2470&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;Builder persona with a proven track record of creating successful programs in ambiguous, early-stage environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ihyvoe&quot; data-start=&quot;2590&quot; data-end=&quot;2755&quot;&gt;Strong editorial judgment with the ability to identify compelling practitioner stories and translate executive conversations into meaningful content opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w7fbhh&quot; data-start=&quot;2756&quot; data-end=&quot;2838&quot;&gt;Excellent executive presence, communication, and relationship management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cz4t76&quot; data-start=&quot;2839&quot; data-end=&quot;2987&quot;&gt;Systems thinker who approaches community building as an operating system, continuously improving processes, feedback loops, and member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bs3i5z&quot; data-start=&quot;2988&quot; data-end=&quot;3092&quot;&gt;Comfortable balancing strategic planning with hands-on execution in a fast-moving startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this position is $150,000 - $200,000 annually and may include equity, benefits, and other components, subject to local eligibility requirements and employment type.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2884)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and helping enterprises unify data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. A leader in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato’s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato provides the trusted foundation for organizations to automate with confidence and operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are looking for an exceptional&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to oversee payroll activities for &lt;strong&gt;Philippines and Korea&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring full compliance with all statutory requirements, accurate processing, and timely submission of government reports. This role will also support payroll operations for other &lt;strong&gt;Asia Pacific countries&lt;/strong&gt; including &lt;strong&gt;Singapore, Australia, Japan, and India&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key responsibility of this role is to &lt;strong&gt;collect, validate, and record all employee changes impacting payroll&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring all supporting documentation is complete, accurate, and saved in the respective payroll processing folders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Payroll Specialist will play a key role in the &lt;strong&gt;global payroll transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with &lt;strong&gt;ADP&lt;/strong&gt; during the payroll transition and actively participating in the &lt;strong&gt;Workday–ADP Celergo integration during Wave 2&lt;/strong&gt;. This individual will also serve as a primary contact for employee payroll inquiries, ensuring resolution within a &lt;strong&gt;24-hour SLA&lt;/strong&gt;, and will collaborate closely with stakeholders across the globe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll Administration (Philippines &amp;amp; Korea focus; APAC support)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End-to-end processing of payroll for the &lt;strong&gt;Philippines and Korea&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring accuracy, timeliness, and compliance with statutory and company policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage payroll activities for additional APAC locations: &lt;strong&gt;Singapore, Australia, Japan, and India&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure full compliance with statutory requirements including government reporting, contributions, remittances, year-end tax or annualization activities, and other regulatory filings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resolve issues and discrepancies with government agencies related to payroll, taxes, and statutory contributions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide summarized payroll reports, immediately after payroll is approved, to the General Accounting team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as main point of contact for any clarification and/or calculation required by the General Accounting team supporting the payroll report numbers, coordinate with the payroll provider as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as main point of contact during statutory audit, for all payroll related support required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Government Relations &amp;amp; Statutory Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liaise with agencies such as &lt;strong&gt;SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG, BIR&lt;/strong&gt;, and Korea statutory bodies (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;NPS, NHIS, NTS&lt;/strong&gt;), as well as relevant entities in Singapore, Australia, Japan, and India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor changes in payroll-related legislation and proactively ensure compliance across all assigned countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage registration, updates, and any required compliance documentation for employees and company entities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Payroll Transformation (ADP Transition &amp;amp; Workday Integration)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actively support the global transition to the new payroll provider &lt;strong&gt;ADP&lt;/strong&gt;, including data migration, validation, parallel testing, and process documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in &lt;strong&gt;Wave 2 integration&lt;/strong&gt; activities between &lt;strong&gt;Workday&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;ADP Celergo&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring accuracy of data flows, configuration alignment, and issue resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with HRIS, Finance, People Ops, IT, and ADP project teams to ensure a smooth transition and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a point of contact for payroll questions, ensuring resolutions within a &lt;strong&gt;24-hour SLA&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide clear guidance and support to employees regarding payslips, deductions, statutory contributions, tax queries, and payroll changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build strong relationships with internal stakeholders across regions including HR, Finance, and Operations teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support internal audits, compliance reviews, and respond to queries from auditors and management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously evaluate payroll processes to identify efficiencies, automation opportunities, and improvements in accuracy and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain accurate payroll documentation, process guides, and SOPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist in troubleshooting payroll system issues and collaborate with system and vendor teams to implement corrections or enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, HR, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum &lt;strong&gt;8&amp;nbsp;years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in payroll processing, preferably within a multi-country or multinational environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience dealing/assisting with &lt;strong&gt;statutory audit&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong end-to-end payroll experience for &lt;strong&gt;Philippines and Korea&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of payroll regulations in Singapore, Australia, Japan, and/or India is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience partnering with &lt;strong&gt;ADP&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Celergo&lt;/strong&gt;, or other global payroll systems preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Workday&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent analytical skills with high attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2940)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

