&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an exceptional Senior Software Engineer to help build the distributed backend that powers our AI agent platform and the developer-facing products around it — the event-driven services, real-time integrations, and APIs that let agents reliably do real work. You&#39;ll be building the systems that need to stay correct and available on our path to 1M users over the next year. You will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build event-driven, horizontally-scalable backend services that process work reliably and correctly even when parts of the system fail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build real-time surfaces and integrations — streaming connections, gateways, and CLIs — that hold up under load.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Integrate LLMs and agentic harnesses into production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive features end-to-end — from ideation and architecture through deployment, observability, and iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Raise the engineering bar through clean, well-tested code, thoughtful reviews, and mentorship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
