&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years shipping and operating production backend systems at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Python, and the judgment to write clean, well-tested, maintainable code under it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep distributed-systems fundamentals: you know how to keep systems correct and available under partial failure, backpressure, and load — and you design for it by default.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with event-driven, streaming, or real-time systems (queues, pub/sub, long-lived connections).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating services in production on Kubernetes in the cloud — and instrumenting them with metrics, tracing, and dashboards so you can debug what you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid API and software-architecture instincts; you make and defend sensible trade-offs in ambiguity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;LLM/agentic and developer-facing product experience (MCP, RAG, APIs, SDKs, CLIs) a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our stack: Python, FastAPI, Postgres, Kubernetes, AWS. You don&#39;t need prior experience with all of it — we care that you can pick it up fast.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;High agency and ownership: You drive work end-to-end, from ambiguity to shipped and iterated, without waiting to be told.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A reliability mindset: You design for failure, not just the happy path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Product-minded:&amp;nbsp; You care about the users using what you build, not just the system behind it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI-native: You use modern AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code) in your daily workflow and stay at the cutting edge of what it can do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;book antiqua&#39;, palatino, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written communication: We work async and write things down.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
