&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be part of Workato’s global solution consulting team and architecture community and own the technical alignment with the customer during the pre-sales lifecycle through workshops and interactions that define the customer’s future state for AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be our customer’s most trusted advisors by realizing Workato’s value propositions and platform capabilities to achieve their business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the technical diagnosis, prescription, and validation phases of the sales cycle and provide a consultative approach in advising customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effectively team with AEs, Solution Architects, and other functions to evangelize our platform, approach, and architecture tailored to the customer’s business and drive the technical sales stages to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in very close alignment with Customer Success to make the solution a reality for the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Articulate and educate on business, technical and architectural concepts to a variety of audiences, including business users, developers, architects, IT operations professionals, and senior IT management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sell the value of Workato products using multiple formats/channels, including phone, presentation, and live/online product demonstrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and deliver custom product demonstrations to support the sales cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform business and technical discovery with customer prospects and be able to architect/build proposed solutions using Workato products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successfully manage and execute technical workshops and proof of concepts (POCs), on-site or remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to respond to functional and technical elements of RFIs/RFPs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collect feedback from the field, synthesize, analyze, and channel it to product management and engineering for the product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for representing the product to customers and at field events such as conferences, seminars, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support Marketing with developer marketing and evangelism activities, including writing blogs, participating in demo-driven webinars, and speaking at industry events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BA/BS or equivalent education - Computer Science degree&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6-10 years of solid pre-sales experience in a SaaS/iPaas organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with automation technologies, middleware, integration architecture patterns, web services technologies, enterprise messaging patterns, APIs, SOA, ESB, BPM, SDKs, Bots and Databases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud technologies - iPaaS, SaaS applications, cloud infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands on, practical working knowledge of SAP Integration and Orchestration approaches and technologies is required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of integration and knowledge of Ruby programming plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to learn new concepts, technologies and solve problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with the ability to convey and relate ideas to others and work collaboratively to get things done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent presentation abilities and composure in front of all levels of technical and business audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to lead architectural discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for technology and translating that passion into business impact for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, as well as presentation skills in front of all audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to travel as needed and to work flexible hours throughout the sales territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2923)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and helping enterprises unify data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. A leader in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato’s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato provides the trusted foundation for organizations to automate with confidence and operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Technical Architect to join our growing team. In this role, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement &amp;amp; Solution Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate as a lead architect in professional services engagements, including customised customer onboarding, statements of work, and other customer enablement activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business requirements sessions with customer technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop architectural designs for customer integrations and automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct recipe reviews and advise on unit, integration, and user acceptance testing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct production readiness assessments and advise on production deployment procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct post-live deployment health checks and provide guidance on recipe and process optimisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thorough knowledge transfer to customer and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Evangelism &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and advise on Workato frameworks, including GEARS and the Workato Embedded Product Guide, aligned to customer organisational needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with AI, agentic automation, and MCP-based integration trends, and help customers understand how these capabilities — including Workato’s Enterprise MCP — can extend and enhance their automation architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a Workato evangelist — demonstrating how Workato drives business automation across both direct and embedded deployments in a broad set of industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the trusted technical advisor to customers and partners from an overall solution, architecture, and implementation perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Value Realization &amp;amp; Change Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on organizational readiness, adoption, and governance practices required for AI and agentic automation initiatives to translate into measurable business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate value-mapping and business case workshops that tie automation and AI initiatives to specific, trackable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and proactively address the non-technical failure modes of AI projects — unclear ownership, poor process fit, weak executive sponsorship, change fatigue — during scoping and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer executive sponsors to define success metrics and track value realization post-go-live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the growth of the Professional Services department by creating or enhancing content such as presentations, demos, white papers, best practices, architecture patterns — including MCP and agentic automation patterns — and online courses for use by customers and to enable our extended team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and train team members from pre-sales and post-sales teams, enabling them with content and knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop content to coach our partner ecosystem on Workato delivery best practices&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field; non-traditional but comparable proven experience will also be considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of technology transformation consulting, including hands-on implementation experience with one or more common integration, middleware, or API management solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven results leading and overseeing customer and/or partner success across: front-end and back-end solution architecture, enterprise architecture, development and test/release management strategies, change management, and direct leadership in designing solutions that meet or exceed customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience documenting business processes and applying technology to optimise and automate them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to engage effectively with technical, business, and C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of security and governance requirements for large enterprise organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with the ability to convey and relate ideas to others and collaborate in a cross-functional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, including the ability to communicate ideas visually and deliver professional presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who can work independently and as part of a distributed team, with a willingness to take ownership of situations and problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to client sites up to 25% (may vary based on prevailing circumstances)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to consult on organizational change and adoption, not solely technical implementation — able to speak credibly to why AI and automation initiatives fail to realize value even when the technology works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an enterprise and/or digital architect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science or Software Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of key applications such as Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday, ServiceNow, SAP, or Oracle E-Business Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud infrastructure platforms including AWS, Azure, and GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a start-up or high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of continuous learning of new technologies and leading projects that push the capabilities of existing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving software expansions as a direct result of professional services engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI and agentic automation concepts — including how LLMs, AI agents, and AI-augmented workflows are being applied in enterprise contexts — and practical experience using AI tools in a professional or delivery setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Model Context Protocol (MCP) and how MCP-based architectures enable AI agents to interact with enterprise systems and workflows; experience with Workato’s Enterprise MCP capabilities is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with change management frameworks (e.g., ADKAR, Kotter) as applied to technology adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or presenting value realization frameworks or business cases to executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2918)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

